        <div className="mt-1" style={{ fontSize: FS.cap, color: P.faint, lineHeight: 1.45 }}>
          Ghost the reference build — Mason's best-achieved aero (≈ CL 0.045 · L/D 2.2 · CoP 0.45) — onto the balance instrument, load curves, force table, run histograms, and the explore leaderboards.
        </div>
